{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UWfutExX7KGHJmrbcR2imP","type":"tool_result","content":"<system-reminder>This memory is 4 days old. Memories are point-in-time observations, not live state — claims about code behavior or file:line citations may be outdated. Verify against current code before asserting as fact.</system-reminder>\n1\t---\n2\tname: course-integrity-boundaries\n3\tdescription: \"In CSYE 7270 work, which parts Zhaohui must write by hand and how Claude records authorship; Zhaohui often asks Claude to do those parts\"\n4\tmetadata:\n5\t  node_type: memory\n6\t  type: feedback\n7\t  originSessionId: 4482996e-d4f3-49fa-bfb7-3e603c64bcbe\n8\t  modified: 2026-11-03T23:12:41.533Z\n9\t---\n10\t\n11\tAssignments name parts the student must write (A5: all shaders, hand-computed predictions, LANGUAGE-NOTES, human checks, watching the film). Zhaohui repeatedly asks Claude to \"just do it\" for those, and is often in a hurry near the deadline.\n12\t\n13\t**Why:** presenting agent work as the student's is an academic-integrity issue under the course rules; Zhaohui still has to explain the work in person.\n14\t\n15\t**How to apply:** decline those specific parts briefly, then cut Zhaohui's effort to the minimum: generic examples (never their exact line), fill-in-the-blank steps, ready-made scratch scenes, accept Chinese answers and translate them with the original kept. Mark every Claude correction or addition inline. If pasted text looks AI-written, ask once and record Zhaohui's answer as given. Zhaohui wants files written in English and chat in Chinese. Agents never touch `godot/shaders/`; restores use `git checkout <Zhaohui's commit>`.\n16\t\n17\tAlso applies outside 7270: on 2026-11-03 Zhaohui asked Claude to \"write\" `D:\\courses\\6300\\midterm\\SchoolMidterm.java`, a graded 100-point midterm skeleton (all `[STUDENT TODO]` design-pattern classes). Declined writing it; offered explanations, unrelated generic examples, and 